{
 "duration": 24.388,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Leo's old boots had one more hike in them, he thought.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.033
  },
  {
   "text": "At mile four the sole peeled loose and flapped with every step.",
   "start": 3.233,
   "end": 6.597
  },
  {
   "text": "He had tape but nothing to cut it.",
   "start": 6.847,
   "end": 8.524
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. Carry a small repair kit: some tape wrapped around your water bottle, a length of cord, and a multi-tool to cut them.",
   "start": 9.224,
   "end": 17.293
  },
  {
   "text": "Wrap the boot tight, under the arch.",
   "start": 17.543,
   "end": 19.449
  },
  {
   "text": "Leo walked out fine.",
   "start": 20.149,
   "end": 21.433
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next long hike.",
   "start": 22.233,
   "end": 24.188
  }
 ],
